63. Final Architectural Position

FC-08 establishes a deliberately narrow but strategically important foundation:

User
  │
  │ relationship
  ▼
UserCompany
  │
  │ relationship
  ▼
Company

This structure allows Foresy to represent:

User without Company
User + Company
User + multiple Companies
User + multiple roles
User + multiple roles + same Company

without introducing artificial constraints or coupling.

It also preserves the distinction between:

real Company
simulation
activity
Mission
CRA
forecast
scenario

Each concept remains independently evolutive.

The Company domain therefore becomes the legal/organizational foundation, while future Feature Contracts will progressively add:

Company
   ↓
Legal / Fiscal context
   ↓
Activity
   ↓
Mission
   ↓
Planning
   ↓
CRA / Realized
   ↓
Simulation
   ↓
Fiscal / Regulatory projections

without collapsing these concepts into a single aggregate.

